",\n    \"focus\": \"Sharp focus on the rabbit family and mushroom house details\",\n    \"lens\": \"Sony FE 90mm f/2.8 Macro G OSS\",\n    \"camera_model\": \"Sony Alpha a7R IV\",\n    \"f-number\": 4.5,\n    \"ISO\": 200,\n    \"shutter_speed\": \"1/125\"\n  },\n  \"effects\": [\n    \"tilt-shift blur\",\n    \"soft bloom\",\n    \"high texture detail\",\n    \"subsurface scattering on mushroom\",\n    \"volumetric light rays\",\n    \"warm color grading\"\n  ]\n}"], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 117, "label": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 214, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [430, 200], "pos": [-2432.15283203125, 926.8623657226562], "id": 6, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "hasSecondTab": false, "ver": "0.3.71", "widget_ue_connectable": {"text": true}, "secondTabText": "Send Back", "enableTabs": false, "secondTabOffset": 80, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode", "tabWidth": 65, "secondTabWidth": 65, "tabXOffset": 10}, "order": 13}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "size": [375.6548767089844, 301.0084533691406], "pos": [-1955.9097900390625, 875.9943237304688], "widgets_values": ["为了呈现“水晶做成的龙”这一主题，我为您设计了一个极具视觉冲击力的提示词方案。这个设计不仅强调了**材质的通透感**，还通过**光影折射**来体现水晶的华丽。\n\n您可以根据需要选择以下不同的视觉风格：\n\n### 方案一：极致华丽·神话史诗感 (Epic Mythical)\n*这种风格适合表现一条巨大的、充满力量感的水晶龙，仿佛刚从远古的神庙中苏醒。*\n\n*   **场景描述 (Scene):** 一条由纯净透明水晶雕琢而成的巨龙，身体蜿蜒穿过云雾缭绕的深渊。龙鳞呈现出多面切割的宝石质感，每一片鳞片都在捕捉周围微弱的光线。\n*   **主体 (Subjects):** 水晶巨龙、破碎的宝石鳞片、流动的云雾、远处的悬浮岛屿。\n*   **材质与特效 (Materials & Effects):** **高折射率 (High Refraction)**、**色散效果 (Chromatic Aberration)**（光线穿过水晶产生的彩虹色边缘）、**次表面散射 (Subsurface Scattering)**、**精细切割面 (Intricate Faceted Surfaces)**。\n*   **灯光 (Lighting):** 强烈的侧逆光 (Rim Lighting)，光线穿透龙身时产生璀璨的折射光斑，营造神圣感。\n*   **风格 (Style):** 电影级渲染 (Cinematic Render)、虚幻引擎5 (Unreal Engine 5)、超写实 (Hyper-realistic)。\n\n---\n\n### 方案二：唯美艺术·微观雕刻感 (Elegant Miniature)\n*这种风格适合表现一种精致、艺术化的感觉，像是一件放在博物馆里的传世艺术品。*\n\n*   **场景描述 (Scene):** 一条极小、极精致的水晶龙，停留在一段枯木或一块原石之上。光线从上方柔和地洒下，通过龙身折射出斑斓的色彩。\n*   **主体 (Subjects):** 艺术雕刻水晶龙、纹理清晰的木材、柔和的光晕。\n*   **材质与特效 (Materials & Effects):** **磨砂与透明结合 (Frosted & Clear texture)**、**极高清晰度 (8K resolution)**、**丁达尔效应 (Tyndall effect)**。\n*   **灯光 (Lighting):** 柔和的摄影棚灯光 (Soft Studio Lighting)，强调形状的轮廓美。\n*   **风格 (Style):** 微观摄影 (Macro Photography)、极简主义 (Minimalism)、艺术品摄影 (Fine Art Photography)。\n\n---\n\n### 💡 建议使用的英文提示词 (Prompt Engineering)\n\n如果您使用 Midjourney, DALL-E 3 或 Stable Diffusion，可以直接复制以下经过优化的提示词：\n\n**【推荐 Prompt - 史诗水晶龙】**\n> **A magnificent dragon made entirely of translucent crystalline quartz, intricate multifaceted scales reflecting rainbow spectrums, soaring through a cosmic nebula, hyper-detailed carving, cinematic lighting, sharp focus on refraction and light dispersion, chromatic aberration, iridescent glow, 8k resolution, unreal engine 5 render, ethereal and majestic --ar 16:9 --v 6.0**\n\n**【中文含义对照】：**\n一条完全由半透明石英水晶构成的壮丽巨龙，复杂的、多面切割的鳞片反射着彩虹光谱，在宇宙星云中翱翔，极度精细的雕刻，电影级灯光，聚焦于折射和光色散，色散效应，虹彩色光泽，8K分辨率，虚幻引擎5渲染，空灵而庄严。\n\n---\n\n### 🌟 进阶小技巧：如何让“水晶”看起来更真实？\n\n在输入提示词时，加入以下关键词可以显著提升质感：\n1.  **Refraction (折射):** 让光线在内部弯曲。\n2.  **Dispersion (色散):** 产生像钻石一样的彩虹色边缘。\n3.  **Prism effect (棱镜效果):** 让光线分解成光谱。\n4.  **Caustics (焦散):** 表现光线穿过透明物体后，在背景上形成的晃动光纹（这是让水晶显真实的灵魂）。\n5.  **Facet (刻面):** 强调像宝石一样的切割感。"], "inputs": [{"name": "anything", "link": 215, "label": "anything", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "id": 98, "type": "ShowAnything|Mie", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui_mienodes", "ver": "1.0.25", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowAnything|Mie"}, "order": 14}], "extra": {"VHS_KeepIntermediate": true, "links_added_by_ue": [], "VHS_MetadataImage": true, "ue_links": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "workflowRendererVersion": "LG", "VHS_latentpreviewrate": 0, "frontendVersion": "1.34